    tags: ['Air Hostess', 'Salary of Air Hostess', 'Air Hostess Salary in India'],
    excerpt: 'TL;DR: In 2026, the average starting salary for an air hostess (cabin crew) in India is projected to be between ₹35,000 and ₹50,000 per month. Experienced cabin crew flying international routes with airlines like Vistara or Air India can earn between ₹1,20,000 to ₹2,00,000 per month. Salaries are expected to rise by 10-15% compared to 2024 due to India\'s massive aviation expansion and new aircraft inductions.',
    intro: 'The Indian aviation sector is experiencing its most aggressive expansion phase in history. With airlines like IndiGo, Air India, and Akasa Air placing record-breaking aircraft orders, the demand for skilled cabin crew has skyrocketed. If you are planning a career in aviation, understanding the financial trajectory is crucial. Here is the complete, data-driven guide to Air Hostess salaries in India for 2026.',
